## Requirements

- Python 3.14
- [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/)

## Setup

```bash
uv sync
uv run pre-commit install
```

## Run

```bash
uv run scrapy list
uv run scrapy crawl quotes -O quotes.jsonl
```

## Add a spider

```bash
uv run scrapy genspider <name> <domain>
```

New spiders land in `src/spiders/`.

## Checks

```bash
uv run ruff check .
uv run ruff format .
uv run pytest
```

## Template updates

Generated from [scrapy-template](https://github.com/darimanner/scrapy-template). Pull template changes with:

```bash
uvx copier update
```
